    },
    "The take was added. Couldn’t save that receipt yet; retry checking its status." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Take wurde hinzugefügt. Die Bestätigung ließ sich noch nicht speichern; prüf den Status nochmal."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Çekim eklendi. Makbuz henüz kaydedilemedi; durumu tekrar kontrol etmeyi dene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timed backgrounds overlap or one is too short. Give each at least half a second without overlap, then save again. Your edits are still here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die zeitlich festgelegten Hintergründe überlappen sich oder einer ist zu kurz. Gib jedem mindestens eine halbe Sekunde ohne Überlappung und speichere dann erneut. Deine Änderungen sind noch da."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Zamanlı arka planlar çakışıyor ya da biri çok kısa. Her birine çakışmadan en az yarım saniye ver, sonra tekrar kaydet. Düzenlemelerin hâlâ burada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timeline can’t be edited right now. Try adding it again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
